zigbee2mqtt (2.14.1-wb102) stable; urgency=medium

  * configuration.yaml is no longer a dpkg conffile: created from a template only when missing
  * serial.port is set from the Zigbee module slot picked in the hardware settings
  * the data of zigbee2mqtt is copied to /var/backups/zigbee2mqtt before install and upgrade
  * the package version comes from debian/changelog instead of the job parameters

 -- Vitalii Gaponov <vitalii.gaponov@wirenboard.com>  Wed, 23 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0300

